<title>JAPAN: Fukutoku Bank to brief media on earnings revision.</title>
<headline>Fukutoku Bank to brief media on earnings revision.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Osaka-based regional bank Fukutoku Bank Ltd said on Wednesday that it would hold a news conference at 4 p.m. (0700 GMT) about a revision of its earnings forecast.</p>
<p>The bank said in November that it expected a parent current profit of 120 million yen in the 1996/97 business year, down from 1.02 billion yen in 1995/96.</p>
</text>
